{"content": "Installation\n\nTo install Multifire and Autofire, select your KOTOR 2 directory path above (if the path is not automatically detected you will have to browse to it manually).\n\nThen press Install to complete the installation. After the installer finishes, you may close it.\n\nUninstallation\n\nYou must first uninstall any mods that you installed after Multifire and Autofire. Failure to do this will result in a botched game installation.\n\nTo uninstall Multifire and Autofire, select your KOTOR 2 directory path above, and go to Tools -> Uninstall Mod/Restore Backup to uninstall the mod.\n", "tags": {"Paragraph_Alignment_Center": [], "Paragraph_Alignment_Left": [], "Font_Styles_Bold": [], "Font_Styles_Italic": [], "Font_Styles_Underline": [["1.0", "1.12"], ["5.11", "5.18"], ["7.0", "7.14"], ["9.9", "9.14"], ["9.53", "9.58"]], "Font_Styles_Overstrike": [], "Background_Colors_Yellow": [], "Text_Colors_Red": [], "Text_Colors_Blue": [], "Font_Sizes_Large": [["1.0", "1.12"], ["7.0", "7.14"]], "Font_Sizes_Extra_Large": []}, "tag_configs": {"Paragraph_Alignment_Center": {"justify": "center"}, "Paragraph_Alignment_Left": {"justify": "left"}, "Font_Styles_Bold": {"font": "Arial 15 bold"}, "Font_Styles_Italic": {"font": "Arial 15 italic"}, "Font_Styles_Underline": {"underline": "1"}, "Font_Styles_Overstrike": {"overstrike": "1"}, "Background_Colors_Yellow": {"background": "#FFFF00"}, "Text_Colors_Red": {"foreground": "#FF0000"}, "Text_Colors_Blue": {"foreground": "#0000FF"}, "Font_Sizes_Large": {"font": "Arial 18"}, "Font_Sizes_Extra_Large": {"font": "Arial 24"}}}